### owners

- POST /owners/register
- GET /owners/{id}
- PUT /owners/{id}

### vehicles

- GET /vehicles?owner_id={ownerId}
- GET /vehicles/{licensePlate}
- POST /vehicles/register
- PUT /vehicles/{licensePlate}
- GET /vehicles/models

### fuel-orders

- GET /fuel-orders?owner_id={ownerId}
- GET /fuel-orders/{orderCode}
- POST /fuel-orders/join-line 
"""
request {
    licensePlate: string,
    stationId: Long
} 
response {
    orderCode: string,
    licensePlate: string,
    stationId: Long,
    queuePosition: int,
    fuelPumpId: Long
}
"""
- PUT /fuel-orders/{orderCode}
